              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "কাকিমা (kākimā) is kāki, \"wife of the father's younger brother\", which CDIAL lists under kākka, \"senior male relative\", a word it takes from Dravidian (CDIAL 2998), + mā, \"mother\"."
